				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://alwaldend.com/docs/projects/kustomization/openspec/spec/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;kustomization-specification&#34;&gt;Kustomization Specification&lt;a class=&#34;td-heading-self-link&#34; href=&#34;#kustomization-specification&#34; aria-label=&#34;Heading self-link&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h2 id=&#34;purpose&#34;&gt;Purpose&lt;a class=&#34;td-heading-self-link&#34; href=&#34;#purpose&#34; aria-label=&#34;Heading self-link&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Provide in-progress Kubernetes resource definitions for Flux, Traefik, and&#xA;cert-manager. This baseline records declared resources at revision&#xA;&lt;code&gt;550d7e79b1f5fdbc2b6017b75178471d6914082f&lt;/code&gt;, observed on 2026-09-08. It does not&#xA;assert successful rendering, reconciliation, or a deployed cluster state.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Sources: &lt;a href=&#34;https://alwaldend.com/docs/&#34;&gt;project README&lt;/a&gt;,&#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;../../../flux-repo/flux-git-src.yaml&#34;&gt;Flux source&lt;/a&gt;,&#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;../../../traefik/flux/release.yaml&#34;&gt;Traefik release&lt;/a&gt;,&#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;../../../traefik/remote/kustomization.yaml&#34;&gt;Traefik remote resources&lt;/a&gt;,&#xA;and &lt;a href=&#34;../../../cert-manager/flux/release.yaml&#34;&gt;cert-manager release&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;requirements&#34;&gt;Requirements&lt;a class=&#34;td-heading-self-link&#34; href=&#34;#requirements&#34; aria-label=&#34;Heading self-link&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;requirement-scoped-flux-repository-source&#34;&gt;Requirement: Scoped Flux repository source&lt;a class=&#34;td-heading-self-link&#34; href=&#34;#requirement-scoped-flux-repository-source&#34; aria-label=&#34;Heading self-link&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Flux GitRepository declaration SHALL select the repository&amp;rsquo;s &lt;code&gt;master&lt;/code&gt;&#xA;branch, refer to the &lt;code&gt;flux-git-src&lt;/code&gt; credential secret, and include only &lt;code&gt;infra&lt;/code&gt;&#xA;and &lt;code&gt;projects/kustomization&lt;/code&gt; from the repository through its ignore rules.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
